### Enrollments – variabili
@baseUrl      = http://localhost:3000
@enrollmentId = 767d906c-1aed-4292-aa0e-5b1dcbafc41f
@studentId    = 0f057dad-6bcf-41dd-a7c8-0d30551ee3f0
@courseId     = c00bf7ce-8bc2-4fec-9bbc-989859765080
@lessonId     = ce9089b2-416d-4035-ab89-14d9338459cb
@studentToken = STUDENT_JWT_TOKEN

# ─── POST /enrollments ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Enroll student in a course
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{studentId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

# ─── PATCH /enrollments/:id/progress ─────────────────────────────────

### 2. Update lesson progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "lessonId": "{{lessonId}}"
}

# ─── Edge cases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3. Enroll – corso inesistente (atteso 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{studentId}}",
  "courseId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999"
}

### 4. Enroll – studente già iscritto (atteso 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{studentId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### 5. Enroll – utente non student (atteso 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### 6. Update progress – enrollment inesistente (atteso 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999/progress
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "lessonId": "{{lessonId}}"
}

### 7. Update progress – UUID non valido (atteso 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/not-a-valid-uuid/progress
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "lessonId": "{{lessonId}}"
}

### 8. Enroll – body non valido, userId non UUID (atteso 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "userId": "not-a-uuid",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}
